@local/dsh-session-delete README · 安装：然后编辑 `$profile\package.json`，合并以下字段（已存在的字段里追加即可）：

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@local/dsh-session-delete": "link:C:/Users/you/code/dsh-session-delete"
  },

</details>

两种方式完成后都需**重启 DeepSeek Harness**，并在「插件管理」页确认 `@local/dsh-session-delete` 已启用。

@local/dsh-session-delete README · 使用说明：1. 重启 DSH 后，把鼠标悬停在侧栏任意会话行上，点击垃圾桶图标；或打开会话行菜单，选择「删除会话…」。
2. 在确认弹窗中点击「删除」。
3. 看到「已删除会话「xxx」」toast 即完成，磁盘上的日志目录同时被清理。

@local/dsh-session-delete README · Installation：New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force "$profile\node_modules\@local" | Out-Null

Then merge these fields into `$profile\package.json` (append inside existing fields):

```json
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@local/dsh-session-delete": "link:C:/Users/you/code/dsh-session-delete"
  },

</details>

Either way, **restart DeepSeek Harness** afterwards and confirm `@local/dsh-session-delete` is enabled on the plugin management page.

@local/dsh-session-delete README · Usage：1. After restarting DSH, hover any session row in the sidebar and click the trash icon, or open the row menu and choose 「删除会话…」.
2. Confirm by clicking 「删除」 in the dialog.
3. The 「已删除会话「xxx」」 toast marks completion — the on-disk log directory is cleaned at the same time.
